674821615229_9044775275073634304_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XPtLhidPK4IQ7kNvwG1XO3W&_nc_oc=AdqFzUyu56rUFzYS0oB6QYAXkjcjb8JoGOYB_PYfdxsfbw8speYOp4BboV0H0OGyq8Y&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQNkVa8h_4qLG5_gBoObIc33PBKL9waXxtg8T1tISZfWcA&oe=6ADCC159"}, {"file_name": "migrated_image.png", "id": "2513502842299488", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162726_1854054711577045_5582650056718155776_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FN8GUXHRdE8Q7kNvwFnY3qJ&_nc_oc=AdpSxnKUQ0ZXr0zd_w_PW4nFiWwlws-h-afdcHmFPly9_9PLwH1QzgSXi8FkoAUmgDA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMYpQFgDNztxQ-RBIX85JEpJUuyHF1Vj8ARH2LxwNtqjQ&oe=6ADCCA16"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Icon.png", "id": "1720845498222971", "uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/11162687_1720845501556304_758256641949827072_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=FU5Z063_ikAQ7kNvwEi__Og&_nc_oc=AdrKwmvza15do9tP045EMDsIRc6ST4W4E7MlMnLEa5nhYKBoqNSA0pl1iiuDrOQtKps&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQMfFum6StPcN-PUgSDni9BhTC6O_hLeLvo6njB2VJHjFg&oe=6ADCC631"}, "display_name": "Evil Presence", "keywords": ["horror", "hospital", "scary", "jumpscare", "haunted"], "long_description": "Venture into the unknown, but beware of what lurks behind these walls. Evil Presence is a physiological horror experience like no other, built exclusively for virtual reality. The hospital once belonged to a very wealthy family but now it has been abandoned. Your goal is to collect bags of money lying, however the hospital is now home to a monstrous abomination, an experiment gone wrong.\n\nEvery play-through will be different as the hospital features some random generation. \n\nCan you make it out alive?\n\nHeadphones and a Gear VR controller are recommended but not required.\n\nWARNING: CONTAINS PLENTY OF JUMP SCARES", "short_descrip